01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
Starring Bill Pullman, Kathy Baker, Jim Caviezel, Tommy Flanagan, and Peter Fonda, the film follows Lefty Brown (Pullman), a Montana
frontiersman seeking vengeance against the outlaws who murdered his friend, the newly elected Senator Edward Johnson (Fonda).

13
01:25:18,750 --> 01:25:24,750
The Ballad of Lefty Brown premiered at South by Southwest on March 11, 2017, and
was theatrically released in the United States on December 15, 2017.

14
